  "description" : "http://anidb.net/ch141116 [Sakamoto Tarou]: the legendary http://anidb.net/ch145945 [former hitman]. To protect the peaceful life he shares with his beloved family, he steps back onto the battlefield once more!\nTo gather information on the mysterious X (http://anidb.net/ch145348 [Slur]), who operates in the shadows, Sakamoto and http://anidb.net/ch142476 [Shin] begin an undercover investigation at the JCC. Meanwhile, http://anidb.net/ch144586 [Nagumo], http://anidb.net/ch144588 [Shishiba], and http://anidb.net/ch144587 [Osaragi] of the Order head to Kyoto on a mission, only to be ambushed by an unexpected assassin...! As conspiracies unfold, the intertwined pasts of a young Sakamoto, Nagumo, http://anidb.net/ch149243 [Rion], and X (Slur) are finally brought to light.\nSource: Official Website",
